<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian tin price falls to new 27-mth low.</title>
<headline>Malaysian tin price falls to new 27-mth low.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's spot tin price fell to a new 27-month low of 13.56 ringgit ($5.43) after a lower London Metal Exchange sparked off initial strong selling here, traders said.</p>
</text>
